      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Polaris Observability\n\nThis is a placeholder dashboard installed by **P10-001** so the dashboards provider has something to load on first start.\n\n**Real dashboards land with P10-003.** They live under `infra/grafana/dashboards/` and cover:\n\n- Ingestion (request rate, accepted/rejected, redaction counts)\n- Processors (consumed/emitted/failed/DLQ, lag)\n- Destinations (delivery success, retries, DLQ volume)\n- ClickHouse (ingest lag, MV failures, projection freshness)\n- Redpanda (throughput, consumer lag, broker health)\n\n**Datasources** (auto-provisioned by P10-001):\n\n- `Prometheus` (default) — `polaris_*` metrics from the ingester, processors, and consumers.\n- `Loki` — structured Pino logs from Polaris services.\n\n**See:** `docs/development/observability.md`",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "polaris-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "UP"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
